{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After years of dissapointing gym memberships, failed sword schools and unfinished sorcery online courses, your hero was sent to Grindstan, the land where all legendary RPG warriors are forged. The grass is so sharp it crits if you fall on it, the rocks gain a level every winter and even the local squirrels have maxed out agility stats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your hero is stuck in the grind, he must return the best. Will he make it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your warrior fights endlessly the minion camps and all loot is scooped automatically. He levels up, slays bosses and occasionally survives. Every now and then there is a random event for extra chaos. Your Job? Manage his stats, upgrade his gear, assign skills, and act like you\u2019re doing something important.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806140/extras/517fa98d84be012f4b5392db731a1dd0.poster.avif?t=1756326306\" width=640 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806140/extras/517fa98d84be012f4b5392db731a1dd0.webm?t=1756326306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806140/extras/517fa98d84be012f4b5392db731a1dd0.mp4?t=1756326306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Customization\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your warrior\u2019s equipment with swords, axes, daggers, armor sets and more. Add enhancements to your weapons for extra stats and most importantly fancy effects. Distribute stat points across Strength, Agility and Magic Power to shape your hero's combat style. Unlock and upgrade active and passive skills to give your fighter the combat advantage he desperately needs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806140/extras/2115a8aa6a672f223d38c0179a6184b7.poster.avif?t=1756326306\" width=606 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806140/extras/2115a8aa6a672f223d38c0179a6184b7.webm?t=1756326306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806140/extras/2115a8aa6a672f223d38c0179a6184b7.mp4?t=1756326306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Other Important Features of the game\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While your character does the hustling, you can, in real life, do some of the following:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sip coffee</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pet your dog</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do spreadsheets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Write emails</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Order pizza</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chat with your imaginary girlfriend</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>&quot;If you want your character to be high-level RPG warrior, send him 2-3 years to Grindstan and forget about him.&quot;</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2014<i>Some wise man</i></strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3806140?t=1756326306","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806140/f3171a468a046199a43d122c0b5fb8c5d9ee2dbe/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756326306","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.co